citic-visa-30pct-overseas-2026h2.content:
Read from the official China CITIC Bank card centre page for the Xiaoyaoyou Visa series on 21 November 2026, the offer runs 1 July to 31 December 2026 and only counts transactions after you enrol in the Dongka Kongjian app:

- Per-transaction rebate: overseas Visa purchases of $50 or more get a random rebate of up to 30%, capped at $50 per household per month, with a $40,000 monthly pool;
- High-spend rebate: 10% on the portion above $8,000 of a calendar month's total, capped at $200 per household per month, with a $45,000 pool (flight, hotel, tuition and rent merchant codes excluded);
- Travel rebate: 10% above $1,000 a month at designated airlines and hotels, capped at $50;
- Tuition rebate: 10% above $5,000 a month at overseas education and rent merchant codes, capped at $100;
- All four together are capped at $300 per household per month; a first Apple Pay bind plus $5.01 of overseas spending adds $5 per card (23 January to 31 December 2026, $120,000 pool, stackable).

The card centre's overview page still links the 1 January to 30 June edition of the 30% offer, while the Xiaoyaoyou product page states 1 July to 31 December with the amounts above; confirm the current announcement inside the app before spending.

